WEBVTT

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.873
Gartlant armored divisions are
assembled by the Japoness frontier!

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.446
Excellent! Tank divisions,
stand ready at the front!

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.286
Krabbensteif, take Japoness down!

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.450
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:00.020
| was born to be with you.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.361
The moment I awoke...

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:07.500
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.193
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:14.738
I was born to hold you.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.911
Lies and truths...

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:22.038
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:26.784
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.655
...won't get to me.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:32.150
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.717
...can be ours once again!

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:40.329
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.200
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.570
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:52.339
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.722
Upon their infiltration of Gartlant...

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.318
...Otaru and company were enraged at
how cruelly Faust treated his people.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:12.660
While Lime and Bloodberry
ran amok through the city...

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:17.226
...Otaru and Cherry set bombs on the
main computer that would destroy it.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:22.237
The plan appeared to have
been a wild success...

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:25.005
...but Luchs had seen
through everything.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:30.473
And now, surrounded by the saber dolls,
what will become of our heroes?!

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:36.548
Maiden Circuits
Win The Day?!

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.997
The game is up, Otaru Mamiya.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.570
You won't get away now!

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:58.873
Say your prayers.

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:00.680
Damn you!

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:11.624
NOW, YOU DIE!

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.520
What the?!

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.799
This way, mister!

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:21.857
It's you!

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:22.800
Hurry!

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.928
Right! Everybody join hands!

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.274
You won't get away!

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.715
Damn it! Where are they?!

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:40.450
Is it Otaru Mamiya's?

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.114
| can't tell. Let's
call in a search party!

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:46.924
How ya holding up, kid?

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:48.461
Michael.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:52.856
My real name's Michael,
but everybody calls me "Mickey."

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:56.835
Mickey, huh? I'm Otaru!
You hold on tight, Mickey!

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:58.371
Right!

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:12.151
Well, if you spot them,
report it in immediately!

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.811
Yes, of course.

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.086
They're gone.

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:23.629
Yessir!

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.601
Thanks for the save, Gramps!

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:32.735
| don't recall saying it was okay
for you to call me "Gramps™

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:35.670
That's not very friendly.

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:38.040
Maybe, it's possible that
they're not actually friendlies...

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.842
Hey, that's the guy we
almost bagged earlier!

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:45.184
It-It's YOU!

00:04:56.162 --> 00:05:01.191
0-0-Otaru! Th-They're not
friendlies!! They're the enemy!

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:05.465
Good God! We've fallen
right into their trap!!!

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:11.938
Hey... We're sorry about all that.
We had no idea who you were...

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:14.571
...50 we had to test you to
see if you were trustworthy.

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:17.014
We didn't mean any harm.
Let's forgive and forget, okay?

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.084
T..Test?

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:22.519
We're crazy pissed off
with Faust ourselves.

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.447
But I still can't believe you
broke through that solid brick wall!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.768
What is it?

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:38.371
I'm hungry!

00:05:46.946 --> 00:05:49.574
I'll be! You have
got food, after all!

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:51.981
It's been so long since
I've eaten a decent meal!

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:55.286
Isn't it good to be alive, Otaru??

00:05:55.988 --> 00:05:58.616
Hands of f, Lime! I've got
dibs on that chicken!!

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:01.294
Yummy!

00:06:01.994 --> 00:06:03.462
It's so good!

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:12.400
Please, help yourself.
You must be hungry.

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:18.334
N-No, thanks.
I'm... not hungry.

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:21.409
Don't be shy, Mickey! Dig in!

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:23.683
But, I...

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.677
Go ahead, Mickey.

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:27.379
But, Grampa...

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:37.822
That explains it.
| thought as much.

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.991
Yes, indeed!
Who would have guessed...

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:42.467
...that Gartlanters
were so gluttonous?

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:47.802
H-Hey... Are you feeding us
with your own precious reserves?!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.278
Why are you doing this for us?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.012
Never mind that. Please, eat.

00:06:57.183 --> 00:06:59.447
<i>You bloody idiot"
We can't eat this</i>

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.924
Why are you doing this?

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:08.518
Because... because...

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:11.927
...you might be able
to help us!

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:25.472
Damn! We can't even dent it!

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:27.411
Don't be intimidated! Keep firing!

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.940
Those Gartlant hell dogs...!

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:46.898
They won't set foot in Japoness!

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:48.434
Charge!

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.911
Do you seriously think
you can take down a saber?!

00:08:05.117 --> 00:08:06.983
Leave this to us.

00:08:09.622 --> 00:08:11.090
After me!

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:53.363
Shogun.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.732
They have arrived
to take Japoness.

00:08:56.936 --> 00:08:59.234
| won't allow the
Shogun to go alone!

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:02.938
We are depending
upon you, Otaru!

00:09:12.585 --> 00:09:14.986
If you successfully
destroy the computer-...

00:09:15.755 --> 00:09:19.020
...we will then attack
the food depots.

00:09:19.091 --> 00:09:21.583
But until then,
we won't make a move.

00:09:22.428 --> 00:09:26.831
After all, even if you fail, we
still have to live in this country!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.631
You may think this seems cowardly...
...but, please understand.

00:09:54.627 --> 00:09:56.425
We have no excuse, my Lord.

00:09:56.495 --> 00:09:59.465
We are presently conducting
a search over the entire city.

00:09:59.532 --> 00:10:02.024
We will bring you the head
of Otaru Mamiya, I swear it...

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:03.694
Don't bother.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.995
You incompetent marionettes...

00:10:06.072 --> 00:10:10.532
...bring me far more
aggravation than relief!

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:13.441
| don't care where you choose to go,
so long as it is away from me!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.005
- B-But, my Lord!
- Fuhrer!

00:10:16.582 --> 00:10:18.914
But, Lord Faust!
If you forsake us, we'll...!

00:10:18.985 --> 00:10:20.919
I beg of you, fuhrer!!

00:10:20.987 --> 00:10:22.580
Please don't abandon us!

00:10:23.522 --> 00:10:28.926
You, who possess the maiden circuits,
cannot live without the love of a man.

00:10:28.995 --> 00:10:30.963
The love of one man...

00:10:31.964 --> 00:10:33.989
Unless you wish to be abandoned...

00:10:36.535 --> 00:10:38.560
...you WILL kill Otaru Mamiya!

00:10:38.971 --> 00:10:40.439
Yes, m'Lord!!

00:10:41.173 --> 00:10:42.868
<i>All right, then! We're off!</i>

00:10:43.943 --> 00:10:46.878
Understood.
Mickey, go get it.

00:10:46.946 --> 00:10:48.414
Right!

00:10:48.948 --> 00:10:49.881
What?

00:10:49.949 --> 00:10:51.144
Here!

00:10:51.217 --> 00:10:53.515
What's that, a lunch box?

00:10:53.586 --> 00:10:55.850
It's a time bomb, silly!

00:10:55.921 --> 00:10:57.047
A time bomb?!

00:10:57.123 --> 00:10:59.182
Oh, how marvelous!

00:10:59.258 --> 00:11:02.193
We used up all of the
bombs we had with us!

00:11:02.261 --> 00:11:05.424
But, just look at how ancient it is.
You think it'll still work?

00:11:06.632 --> 00:11:09.533
Don't make fun of it!
It's REALLY powerfull!

00:11:09.769 --> 00:11:13.228
Thank you, Mickey!
We can really use this!

00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:16.102
Take these, too!

00:11:16.175 --> 00:11:17.006
What are these?

00:11:17.076 --> 00:11:20.535
They're flash pellets. I used
one to help you yesterday.

00:11:20.613 --> 00:11:24.243
Oh...! But, are you sure?
Don't YOU need this?

00:11:24.784 --> 00:11:26.843
Nope! Not if you can use it!

00:11:26.919 --> 00:11:28.512
Okay, thanks!

00:11:28.954 --> 00:11:30.649
Okay, gang! Let's go!

00:11:56.582 --> 00:11:58.448
Okay, now what?

00:11:58.517 --> 00:12:01.782
They've got someone with the same
abilities as Cherry on their side.

00:12:01.854 --> 00:12:03.845
They probably know we're coming.

00:12:03.923 --> 00:12:06.620
Otaru, Otaru! I found my friend!!

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:08.421
What? Your friend?

00:12:08.494 --> 00:12:09.723
Yeah!

00:12:09.795 --> 00:12:11.263
Huh? He's gone.

00:12:13.933 --> 00:12:15.901
A m-m-m-m...

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:17.402
MOUSE!

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:19.165
Oh! There he is!

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:20.706
Come back!

00:12:24.043 --> 00:12:25.704
There he goes again...

00:12:25.911 --> 00:12:28.005
Hey! Come on out!

00:12:30.483 --> 00:12:33.453
Lime!! G-Get rid
of it, g-quick!!

00:12:33.519 --> 00:12:34.543
Illtll?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.213
IT! You know!

00:12:43.062 --> 00:12:44.496
Squeak.

00:12:45.197 --> 00:12:46.722
That hurt.

00:12:47.166 --> 00:12:48.691
And it serves you right!

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:50.862
That's it! We can use this!

00:12:55.174 --> 00:12:56.938
0-0-0-Otaru...!

00:12:57.009 --> 00:13:00.468
I-1-1-I'm claustrophobic...!

00:13:00.546 --> 00:13:02.071
How nice for you.

00:13:02.948 --> 00:13:06.543
Wait, Otaru... What if we
run into a mouse down here?!

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:10.184
If that happens, you can
bid it "good afternoon™

00:13:10.256 --> 00:13:11.883
Where are we now, Cherry?

00:13:12.124 --> 00:13:13.592
1.I check!

00:13:14.994 --> 00:13:16.484
Squeak.

00:13:27.239 --> 00:13:29.207
He WILL come here.

00:13:29.942 --> 00:13:33.970
This time, we must regain
Lord Faust's trust without fail!

00:13:42.521 --> 00:13:43.955
Bingo!

00:13:44.023 --> 00:13:45.787
Somehow, we made it.

00:13:45.858 --> 00:13:48.020
My ears are still ringing...

00:13:48.093 --> 00:13:50.084
And whose fault is THAT, huh?!

00:13:50.162 --> 00:13:54.121
C'mon... Can't we get out of
this cramped place, Otaru?!

00:13:54.934 --> 00:13:56.561
Wait!

00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:58.967
What is it, Otaru?

00:13:59.038 --> 00:14:00.506
Are they on to us?

00:14:00.573 --> 00:14:02.439
- Cherry, tell me!
- Yes?

00:14:02.508 --> 00:14:04.272
Where's the privy?

00:14:04.977 --> 00:14:07.674
The privy, the privy!
I gotta go, NOW!

00:14:07.947 --> 00:14:09.972
Ack! I'm gonna wet myself!
Hurry, hurry!

00:14:10.049 --> 00:14:12.518
- Now, see here...
- That looks had, Otaru.

00:14:12.885 --> 00:14:14.478
Um...! Um...!

00:14:15.454 --> 00:14:18.947
I'm sorry. I haven't enough
data to locate a washroom.

00:14:19.625 --> 00:14:21.525
I can't hold it any longer?!

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:23.494
A-A-Actually, Otaru...
| gotta go, too!

00:14:23.562 --> 00:14:25.690
<i>What?! AL Al right...
L-listen, Hanagata...</i>

00:14:25.764 --> 00:14:27.027
If we go together,
it won't be so scary!

00:14:27.099 --> 00:14:28.567
GO!

00:14:29.101 --> 00:14:30.569
Eek!

00:14:32.171 --> 00:14:33.400
Yeesh.

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:43.378
- There he is!!!
- What?!

00:14:43.649 --> 00:14:45.117
Ready...

00:14:46.085 --> 00:14:48.884
Open fire! Don't stop until
you are out of ammunition!!

00:15:05.004 --> 00:15:08.167
We've been expecting you,
Otaru Mamiya!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.470
It's a curse to be so popular.

00:15:10.542 --> 00:15:12.943
Let's save the smart talk for
when we have our trousers on.

00:15:15.981 --> 00:15:17.005
T-Time out!

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:18.550
Ready...

00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:21.520
I'll rip you apart.

00:15:21.587 --> 00:15:24.522
Otaru! Get behind us!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.615
No, that won't be necessary.

00:15:26.692 --> 00:15:28.160
Take them!!

00:15:34.199 --> 00:15:35.860
| won't fall for that again!

00:15:40.706 --> 00:15:41.502
The exit!

00:15:41.573 --> 00:15:43.041
They won't escape!!

00:15:51.517 --> 00:15:52.985
Shit!

00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:55.478
There's no time for that, Otaru!

00:15:55.554 --> 00:15:57.750
You dumb-ass!
You know what I meant"

00:15:57.823 --> 00:15:59.882
Master Otaru!
We only have one minute!

00:16:00.526 --> 00:16:01.994
Look sharp!

00:16:08.067 --> 00:16:10.764
Cherry, are you saying
that you've set the bomb?

00:16:10.836 --> 00:16:13.862
Yes! Right when you threw
the flash pellet!!

00:16:13.939 --> 00:16:15.407
WAY TO GO!

00:16:39.999 --> 00:16:41.467
They have overrun the main gate!

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.448
CHERRY?!?

00:16:57.149 --> 00:16:58.446
Five seconds!

00:16:58.517 --> 00:17:01.418
Four, three, two, one!

00:17:02.154 --> 00:17:03.644
ZERO!

00:17:04.857 --> 00:17:06.791
N-No way! It didn't go of f!

00:17:06.859 --> 00:17:09.294
I knew it! It was too old!

00:17:11.497 --> 00:17:13.556
- Crap!
- Otaru, look out

00:17:34.319 --> 00:17:36.185
They stopped moving...!

00:17:36.922 --> 00:17:38.822
W-What is it?!
What happened?!?

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:40.882
The computer...
It's shut down!

00:17:46.932 --> 00:17:48.525
Wh...What happened?!

00:17:49.068 --> 00:17:50.912
Otaru! That's urine!

00:17:50.936 --> 00:17:54.463
I get it...! THAT'S what
shorted out the computer!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.508
Y...You gotta be kidding...

00:17:59.878 --> 00:18:01.312
What's she up to now?!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:04.475
Don't tell me... She's going to
assimilate herself into the computer!

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:07.310
Say WHAT?!

00:18:07.386 --> 00:18:09.115
Otaru Mamiya, DIE!

00:18:10.422 --> 00:18:12.516
You're gonna tangle with ME.

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:17.105
<i>Otaru! Cherry and I will
hold them of ! Stop her!</i>

00:18:17.129 --> 00:18:18.153
YOU GOT IT!

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.699
- I'm coming, too!
- Otaru!!

00:18:22.668 --> 00:18:25.694
If I fail this time,
Lord Faust will abandon me!

00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:28.138
| cannot let that happen.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.709
- Stop!
- Too late!

00:18:43.889 --> 00:18:46.358
Otaru, they're all up again!

00:18:48.026 --> 00:18:51.189
Master Otaru! You have to
confuse her emotionally!

00:18:51.263 --> 00:18:53.527
You must distract her to
stop the assimilation!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.690
Confuse her emotionally?

00:18:58.103 --> 00:18:59.969
This is bad, Otaru!

00:19:00.038 --> 00:19:01.528
Her emotions...?

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:03.573
Master Otaru!!

00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:05.303
Her emotions... Her MIND!

00:19:05.944 --> 00:19:07.070
Otarul

00:19:07.146 --> 00:19:08.841
Mess with her mind...?!

00:19:08.914 --> 00:19:10.006
Otaru!

00:19:10.082 --> 00:19:11.982
Her heart...

00:19:14.786 --> 00:19:16.413
That's it!

00:19:18.657 --> 00:19:20.523
W-What are you...

00:19:23.061 --> 00:19:25.496
HE... KISSED... HER...!

00:19:39.745 --> 00:19:42.237
- That's it!
- Yes. It's time to move!

00:19:42.748 --> 00:19:44.580
He did it!

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:48.813
What?! The main computer
has been WHAT?!

00:19:48.887 --> 00:19:50.753
We'll need several hours
to start the back up, sir!

00:19:54.393 --> 00:19:56.691
Otaru Mamiya!

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:08.497
All right! FOOD!

00:20:12.477 --> 00:20:14.445
They all look so happy!

00:20:15.047 --> 00:20:16.674
That's great!

00:20:16.748 --> 00:20:18.238
Thank you.

00:20:18.317 --> 00:20:19.682
Hey, Gramps!

00:20:19.751 --> 00:20:21.810
We owe this all to you!

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:23.355
Otaru!!

00:20:25.057 --> 00:20:28.322
Isn't this great?! Now you'll
always get enough to eat!

00:20:28.393 --> 00:20:30.020
Yeah!

00:20:30.095 --> 00:20:31.790
Let's go, Mickey.

00:20:31.863 --> 00:20:34.491
Wait, Grampa!
Wait for me!

00:20:35.934 --> 00:20:37.402
Hey, Mickey!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:39.965
Take care.

00:20:40.038 --> 00:20:42.405
I will!
See you again sometime!

00:20:42.474 --> 00:20:43.964
Yeah!

00:20:44.042 --> 00:20:45.339
Goodbye!

00:20:46.345 --> 00:20:47.813
Later!

00:20:48.347 --> 00:20:49.815
Well, let's go home!

00:20:55.587 --> 00:20:57.282
<i>. Huh?</i>

00:20:57.356 --> 00:21:00.087
| understand what the situation
was like... Really I do, but still!

00:21:00.158 --> 00:21:04.686
You haven't even kissed ME yet...
And there you go, kissing one of THEM.

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:08.291
What's the big deal?!
What's done is done.

00:21:08.934 --> 00:21:11.767
| WON'T ACCEPT THAT EITHER, OTARU!

00:21:11.837 --> 00:21:13.362
YOU should be able to!

00:21:13.438 --> 00:21:15.668
Otaru! Kiss me, too!

00:21:15.941 --> 00:21:17.739
Now, h-hold on there!

00:21:17.809 --> 00:21:20.540
Hey, look! Faust is skipping the jig
with his hair in a topknot!

00:21:21.546 --> 00:21:22.513
Where?

00:21:22.581 --> 00:21:24.140
Hey! He's getting away!

00:21:24.216 --> 00:21:26.446
Come back here!!

00:21:26.618 --> 00:21:29.588
The hell I will, bozos!

00:21:29.655 --> 00:21:32.522
...bozos! ..bozos! ..bozos!

00:21:53.512 --> 00:21:57.210
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:57.282 --> 00:22:01.014
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:01.119 --> 00:22:03.986
Just think of me...

00:22:04.056 --> 00:22:08.653
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:08.894 --> 00:22:12.626
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:12.698 --> 00:22:16.396
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:16.568 --> 00:22:20.266
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:22.103
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:22.174 --> 00:22:26.133
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:28.246 --> 00:22:30.544
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:30.615 --> 00:22:35.610
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:35.821 --> 00:22:39.416
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:39.624 --> 00:22:43.254
...one step at a time.

00:22:43.495 --> 00:22:47.090
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:47.165 --> 00:22:50.965
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:51.136 --> 00:22:54.697
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:55.040 --> 00:23:01.036
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:10.322 --> 00:23:11.619
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:16.184
Yay! We get to go to a hot spring!
C'mon, Otaru! Let's take a dip!

00:23:16.261 --> 00:23:20.061
Huh? I can't move. Why?!

00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:24.178
YIKES! The underground plasma energy
is going crazy! Otaru, run!

00:23:24.202 --> 00:23:27.968
I don't want you to get hurt for us!

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:32.899
My First Kiss Tasted Like
Plasma Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:32.978 --> 00:23:34.969
I love you, Otaru!
